 "method": "Approximate analytic estimate, not a coupled photon\u2013electron transport simulation. Primary fluence uses inverse-square normalization and exponential attenuation from XCOM water coefficients. Compton recoil spectra and directions use Klein\u2013Nishina kinematics; a single-scatter buildup estimate supplies the scattered component. Electron slowing-down fluence is estimated from local charged-particle equilibrium, ESTAR stopping powers and ranges, with an approximate delta-ray contribution. Kerma follows energy transfer to charged particles with a radiative-loss correction. PDD and the Spencer\u2013Attix ratio are approximate; the detailed spectra, scatter, and dose quantities would require Monte Carlo transport for reliable precision.",
